summary:
  A paused player's needle under one second counts as one nobody knows, and
  the second the pause kept speaks for it.

history:
  An episode that streams, paused at 120 s and dragged to its start, came
  back at 120 on Play. Not knowing is a fact about the player, that it lost
  the source or has not loaded it; where it holds the file paused, zero is
  the listener's own choice.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      if (playerPaused === true && seekWaits !== true && Number.isFinite(positionMs) && positionMs >= 0)

replace:
      if (playerPaused === true && seekWaits !== true && Number.isFinite(positionMs) && positionMs >= 1000)

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_a_needle_taken_to_the_start_under_a_pause_is_the_listeners_choice
  and tests/qml/tst_transportroads.qml::test_a_paused_stream_dragged_to_its_start_comes_back_at_the_start.
  Line-neutral.
